@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### Reset the deterministic evaluator data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/test/reset

### Seed The Grand Hotel and its six rooms (safe to repeat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/test/seed

### Find the seeded hotel by case-insensitive name substring
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotels?name=grand
Accept: application/json

### A successful search with no matches is an empty list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotels?name=unknown
Accept: application/json

### Find rooms suitable for three guests; only deluxe rooms qualify
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotels/1/availability?check_in=2026-12-10&check_out=2026-12-12&guests=3
Accept: application/json

### Invalid stays are rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotels/1/availability?check_in=2026-12-12&check_out=2026-12-12&guests=1
Accept: application/json
